	(text "PROG 13.7k: 3 cells, 750 kHz (verify). ILIM_HIZ divider: about 3 A input limit (verify);\nfirmware sets the input current by source (PD contract, or 0.5 A on PROG).\nTS: 5.23k / 30.1k with a 10k NTC at the cells. CE low: charging enabled.\nCHARGE LED on REGN, so it also works with the board switched off."
